From: STQ1_0 ternary quantization (ggml-org/llama.cpp pull request #22836)
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cpu : add STQ1_0 ternary quantization with ARM NEON vec_dot kernel

Source: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/22836
PR head: 1e411d8f5a1e23525fa3265dfb4bd76265465397 (open, not merged upstream)
Rebased onto: b11808 (4912ac2). Two hunks were adjusted for b11808:
  - ggml/include/ggml.h: the context after GGML_TYPE_COUNT changed upstream.
  - ggml/src/ggml-cpu/arch-fallback.h: the x86 section has no quants.c block,
    so the STQ1_0 generic mapping starts a new one.

Apply with: git -c core.autocrlf=false apply <this file>

